AUDIO: 'different model, you take what you\'re given. And in February, the rules got sharper. Anthropic updated its terms. So that consumer subscription tokens can\'t be used inside third-party tools'

[01:55] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'anymore. The enforcement landed in April. Overnight, every alternative coding agent lost the cheap ride. If you want Claude inside them, you pay full API rates. The open-source answer has two parts,'

[02:08] [scene:talk]
