AUDIO: 'into the model alias. Third, when routing breaks, it can break spectacularly. Early on, a user called Paraflu, pointed Open Code at a keyless free tier,'

[15:05] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'hit an infinite retry loop of authentication errors, and the logs filled his entire disk. The maintainer called it a self-inflicted denial of service and shipped a fix.'

[15:17] [scene:talk]
