[16:45] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Credit where due, he corrected it. But the biggest red light is the terms of service. Pooling free tiers through a proxy violates several providers\' rules. Omni root\'s own documentation says so.'

[16:59] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
